## Open question for the orchestrator (default taken)

B1 on D6 and L4 fail at HEAD. Should Green fix both in production code, or should the orchestrator
amend the two rows? Default, and the one this role took: Green fixes both. The fixes are a compact
class-screen lyric layout and a 44 px clip control.

